The audio files in this directory are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

They were synthesised from scratch by tools/generate_sounds.py - pure additive
synthesis with numpy, no samples, no recordings and no third-party audio
material of any kind. Re-run the generator to reproduce them bit for bit.

You may use, modify and redistribute them for any purpose, with or without
